# Paired Haxe runner entry for the place contract module.
# Run from the repository root:
#   nix develop -c haxe tests/haxe/place-contract/paired.hxml
# The output path is supplied by the caller so every attempt writes into
# its own run directory:
#   ... -js out/place-contract/runs/<run>/paired.js
-cp tests/haxe/place-contract
-cp samples
-main place.PlaceStaticMain
